the Structure**\n\nThe entire framework seems complete and ready. I'm double-checking the final details, confirming the enum values, and the double quotes. The reasons behind the tag selections are clearly defined and support the overall metabolic strategy for Codes. I'm prepared to move on.\n\n\n"},{"text":"{\n  \"L0_tags\": [\"Main Dish\", \"Complete Meal\"],\n  \"L0_reason\": \"It's lunch time, and since you're at home, we want a substantial meal that sets the metabolic tone for the rest of your day.\",\n  \"L1_tags\": [\"Violates Alcohol-Free\"],\n  \"L1_reason\": \"Keeping things clean and focused on your fat loss goals by filtering out non-essential additives.\",\n  \"L2_tags\": [\"Protein Score\", \"Stable Energy\", \"Satiety Score\"],\n  \"L2_reason\": \"High protein and stable energy are our secret weapons to hunger-proof your 8 PM 'witching hour' and keep your insulin steady.\",\n  \"L3_tags\": [\"Effort Score\", \"One-Pot\"],\n  \"L3_reason\": \"Since you're prepping at home, let's keep the cleanup minimal and the process efficient so it doesn't feel like a chore.\",\n  \"L4_tags\": [\"Savory\", \"Comfort Food\"],\n  \"L4_reason\": \"Leaning into savory comfort now helps satisfy your brain's reward center, making it much easier to ignore the dessert monster later.\",\n  \"tag_priority_order\": [\"L2\", \"L3\", \"L4\"],\n  \"tag_priority_reason\": \"Metabolic stability (L2) is the primary strategy to solve your late-night hunger obstacle, followed by convenience (L3) to ensure you actually stick to the plan.\"\n}"}],"role":"model"}},{"role":"user","meta":{"entrance":"lunch_1100","history_version":1,"event_type":"lunch_1100","run_id":"2026022611124101KJCTD9Q5AXP6MRH1Z0C73Q1J"},"custom_content":{"items":[{"text":"\u003cearly_conversation_summary\u003e\n// The following content is from the file history_summary.md\n[Working Note 'history_summary.md' is empty or not available]\n\u003c/early_conversation_summary\u003e"},{"text":"\u003ccoach_plan\u003e\n[Working 