nting the blood sugar crashes that often lead to dessert cravings. It's a comforting, complete meal that feels indulgent but keeps your fat-loss goals on track.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"64675\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Complete Meal\",\n            \"High Protein\",\n            \"Complex Carbs\",\n            \"Stable Energy\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"Creamy Asiago Chicken Power Bowl\",\n      \"recipe_subtitle\": \"High-protein chicken with a savory yogurt-cheese glaze\",\n      \"recommendation_text\": \"Using Greek yogurt in the sauce boosts the protein content without adding excessive calories. This savory, creamy dish satisfies the 'comfort' need while giving your metabolism the fuel it needs to burn fat efficiently.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"93430\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Main Dish\",\n            \"High Protein\",\n            \"Creamy\",\n            \"Low Carb\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"Peach \u0026 Walnut Breakfast Duo\",\n      \"recipe_subtitle\": \"Fruity smoothie paired with a light jell-o crunch\",\n      \"recommendation_text\": \"Perfect for when you want something light but sweet. The walnuts provide healthy fats that slow down digestion, helping you avoid the mid-morning hunger pangs that usually derail your progress.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"52052\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Breakfast\",\n            \"Sweet\",\n            \"Low Effort\",\n            \"Smoothie\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"142089\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Side Dish\",\n            \"Sweet\",\n            \"Fruity\",\n            \"Low Fat\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"German Potato Bacon \u0026 Matcha Reset\"