Because she's at zero calories, I'll emphasize that she can add snacks or double up on the meals. Finally, all the JSON structures are being finalized.\n\n\n"},{"text":"{\n  \"recipes\": [\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"The Dessert-Blocker Medley\",\n      \"recipe_subtitle\": \"High-protein ham + fiber-rich squash to crush 8 PM cravings\",\n      \"recommendation_text\": \"Since you haven't logged any fuel today, your brain is going to scream for sugar by 8 PM. This ham and veggie combo is your tactical shield—it’s packed with protein and fiber to stabilize your insulin and keep that dessert monster quiet.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"14003\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Main Dish\",\n            \"High Protein\",\n            \"Satiety Score\",\n            \"Savory\",\n            \"One-Pot\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"79814\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Side Dish\",\n            \"Low Effort\",\n            \"Veggies\",\n            \"Savory\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"Shrimp \u0026 Bok Choy Volume Bowl\",\n      \"recipe_subtitle\": \"Lean protein + high volume for a total metabolic reset\",\n      \"recommendation_text\": \"You’re running on an empty tank, codes! This shrimp salad gives you massive volume to fill your stomach without the heavy calorie load, plus some whole-grain bread to keep your energy steady through the night.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"50558\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Complete Meal\",\n            \"High Protein\",\n            \"Stable Energy\",\n            \"Fresh\",\n            \"High Volume\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"69125\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Side Dish\",\n            \"Carb\",\n            \"Fiber\",\n            \"Low Effort\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"Honey-Sesame Chicken \u0026 Mash\",\n      \"recipe_subtitle\": \"Savory-sweet satisfaction that actually keeps you full\",\n      \"recommendation_text\": \"I know you love desserts, so let's use that! This honey-sesame chicken hits those sweet notes but pairs it with 25g of protein to stop a sugar spike, while the rutabaga mash keeps things comforting and low-effort.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"94472\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Main Dish\",\n            \"Protein Score\",\n            \"Savory\",\n            \"Medium Effort\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"11288\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Side Dish\",\n            \"Low Effort\",\n            \"Comfort Food\",\n            \"Veggies\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"Tuna \u0026 Red Pepper Pasta\",\n      \"recipe_subtitle\": \"Quick pantry win for a busy Wednesday night\",\n      \"recommendation_text\": \"If you're feeling low on bandwidth after a long day, this is your fastest route to a balanced meal. The tuna provides the protein anchor you need to prevent a late-night snack hunt later.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"9064\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Complete Meal\",\n            \"Quick \u0026 Easy\",\n            \"Pantry Staple\",\n            \"Savory\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"Mexican Bean Crepes\",\n      \"recipe_subtitle\": \"Savory comfort that fights off the midnight munchies\",\n      \"recommendation_text\": \"These crepes are a great way to get in fiber and protein while feeling like a 'treat' meal. It’s a smart system to satisfy that craving for something different without wrecking your metabolic goals.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"97535\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            