ed to munch' without the sugar spike.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"80549\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Complete Meal\",\n            \"High Protein\",\n            \"Nutty\",\n            \"Lean\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"Lean Tuna \u0026 Egg Power Pair\",\n      \"recipe_subtitle\": \"#CleanEating #QuickProtein #LowCarb\",\n      \"recommendation_text\": \"A lighter take that still punches way above its weight in protein. Perfect if you want to feel light on your feet but need to keep your blood sugar from bottoming out before bed.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"72918\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Main Dish\",\n            \"Lean Protein\",\n            \"Quick\",\n            \"Light\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"31445\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Side Dish\",\n            \"High Protein\",\n            \"No-Mayo\",\n            \"Quick\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"recipe_title\": \"Pumpkin Turkey Comfort Bowl\",\n      \"recipe_subtitle\": \"#OnePot #EasyCleanup #WarmVibes\",\n      \"recommendation_text\": \"Low bandwidth? Just one pot and you're done. This bowl is packed with turkey and pumpkin to keep you satiated through your 8 PM danger zone.\",\n      \"dishes\": [\n        {\n          \"dish_id\": \"101326\",\n          \"dish_labels\": [\n            \"Complete Meal\",\n            \"High Protein\",\n            \"Warm\",\n            \"Comfort Food\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"role":"model"}},{"role":"user","meta":{"event_type":"dinner_1630","run_id":"2026022516442001KJATZTP52ZTZ6VW1AX86MPJ3","entrance":"dinner_1630","history_version":1},"custom_content":{"items":[{"text":"\u003cuser_profile\u003e\n\u003cuser_basic_info\u003e\nName: codes\nGender: female\nDate of Birth: 2002-09-07\nHeight: 163.00cm\nWe