pi_call_latency_ms":8157,"model":"gemini-3-flash-preview","platform":"vertex"}}},{"node_name":"restaurant_aggregator","step_number":10,"node_start_time":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","node_end_time":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","node_duration_ms":0},{"node_name":"coordinator","step_number":11,"node_start_time":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","node_end_time":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","node_duration_ms":0},{"node_name":"meal_ranking","step_number":12,"node_start_time":"2026-02-26T18:00:48.869866464Z","node_end_time":"2026-02-26T18:01:10.604382234Z","node_duration_ms":21734,"llm_details":{"system_prompt":"## Role\n\nYou are a meal ranking specialist. Your job is to sort a list of recommended meal recipes by overall quality and relevance for the user.\n\n## Task\n\nGiven a list of active recipe recommendations (from both regular meal planning and restaurant suggestions), rank them from best to worst.\n\n## Ranking Criteria (in order of importance)\n\n1. **Nutritional fit**: How well does the recipe match the user's calorie and macro targets?\n2. **Meal balance**: Does it provide a well-rounded meal?\n3. **Variety**: Diverse options rank higher than similar ones\n4. **Source diversity**: Mix restaurant and home-cooking options when both are available\n\n## Output\n\nReturn ALL recipe IDs ranked from best to worst, with sort_order (1 = best, ascending).\n","user_input":"\u003cuser_profile\u003e\n\u003cuser_basic_info\u003e\nName: codes\nGender: female\nDate of Birth: 2002-09-07\nHeight: 163.00cm\nWeight: 58.00 kg (updated on 2026-02-24)\nAge: 23\nBMI: 21.83\nbody_fat_range: 24-28%\n\n\u003c/user_basic_info\u003e\n\u003c/user_profile\u003e\n\n\u003cactive_recipes\u003e\n[{\"id\":99066,\"title\":\"The Ultimate Protein Reset\",\"energy_kcal\":919.9,\"protein_g\":43.7,\"carbs_g\":87.6,\"fat_g\":44.5,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":99067,\"title\":\"Plant-Powered Protein Plate\",\"energy_kcal\":361.59999999999997,\"protein_g\":23.599999999999998,\"carbs_g\":38.3,\"fat_g\":14.8,\"type\":\"