mended meal recipes by overall quality and relevance for the user.\n\n## Task\n\nGiven a list of active recipe recommendations (from both regular meal planning and restaurant suggestions), rank them from best to worst.\n\n## Ranking Criteria (in order of importance)\n\n1. **Nutritional fit**: How well does the recipe match the user's calorie and macro targets?\n2. **Meal balance**: Does it provide a well-rounded meal?\n3. **Variety**: Diverse options rank higher than similar ones\n4. **Source diversity**: Mix restaurant and home-cooking options when both are available\n\n## Output\n\nReturn ALL recipe IDs ranked from best to worst, with sort_order (1 = best, ascending).\n","user_input":"\u003cuser_profile\u003e\n\u003cuser_basic_info\u003e\nName: codes\nGender: female\nDate of Birth: 2002-09-07\nHeight: 163.00cm\nWeight: 58.00 kg (updated on 2026-02-24)\nAge: 23\nBMI: 21.83\nbody_fat_range: 24-28%\n\n\u003c/user_basic_info\u003e\n\u003c/user_profile\u003e\n\n\u003cactive_recipes\u003e\n[{\"id\":94453,\"title\":\"Zesty Garlic Shrimp Pasta\",\"energy_kcal\":502.2,\"protein_g\":33.4,\"carbs_g\":44.9,\"fat_g\":20.1,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":94454,\"title\":\"Italian Lemon Butter Chicken\",\"energy_kcal\":659.6,\"protein_g\":26.8,\"carbs_g\":37.4,\"fat_g\":44.9,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":94455,\"title\":\"Metabolic Reset Shrimp Bowl\",\"energy_kcal\":502.2,\"protein_g\":33.4,\"carbs_g\":44.9,\"fat_g\":20.1,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":94456,\"title\":\"Savory Cravings Crusher Chicken\",\"energy_kcal\":659.6,\"protein_g\":26.8,\"carbs_g\":37.4,\"fat_g\":44.9,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":94457,\"title\":\"High-Protein Garlic Shrimp Reset\",\"energy_kcal\":502.2,\"protein_g\":33.4,\"carbs_g\":44.9,\"fat_g\":20.1,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":94537,\"title\":\"**Taco Bell** Satiety Combo\",\"energy_kcal\":540,\"protein_g\":28,\"carbs_g\":68,\"fat_g\":17,\"type\":\"restaurant\",\"label\":\"\"}