duration_ms":11424,"llm_details":{"system_prompt":"## Role\n\nYou are a meal ranking specialist. Your job is to sort a list of recommended meal recipes by overall quality and relevance for the user.\n\n## Task\n\nGiven a list of active recipe recommendations (from both regular meal planning and restaurant suggestions), rank them from best to worst.\n\n## Ranking Criteria (in order of importance)\n\n1. **Nutritional fit**: How well does the recipe match the user's calorie and macro targets?\n2. **Meal balance**: Does it provide a well-rounded meal?\n3. **Variety**: Diverse options rank higher than similar ones\n4. **Source diversity**: Mix restaurant and home-cooking options when both are available\n\n## Output\n\nReturn ALL recipe IDs ranked from best to worst, with sort_order (1 = best, ascending).\n","user_input":"\u003cuser_profile\u003e\n\u003cuser_basic_info\u003e\nName: codes\nGender: female\nDate of Birth: 2002-09-07\nHeight: 163.00cm\nWeight: 58.00 kg (updated on 2026-02-24)\nAge: 23\nBMI: 21.83\nbody_fat_range: 24-28%\n\n\u003c/user_basic_info\u003e\n\u003c/user_profile\u003e\n\n\u003cactive_recipes\u003e\n[{\"id\":88979,\"title\":\"Creamy Fruit \\u0026 Bun Morning Reset\",\"energy_kcal\":367,\"protein_g\":17.5,\"carbs_g\":20.1,\"fat_g\":25,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":88980,\"title\":\"Sweet Glazed Ham \\u0026 Pumpkin Power\",\"energy_kcal\":352.1,\"protein_g\":18.8,\"carbs_g\":44.9,\"fat_g\":11.3,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":88981,\"title\":\"Venison White Chili \\u0026 Steamed Buns\",\"energy_kcal\":304.2,\"protein_g\":17.5,\"carbs_g\":29.700000000000003,\"fat_g\":13.399999999999999,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":88982,\"title\":\"Asiago Chicken \\u0026 Healing Cabbage Volume\",\"energy_kcal\":404.29999999999995,\"protein_g\":31.9,\"carbs_g\":14.3,\"fat_g\":23.099999999999998,\"type\":\"recipes\",\"label\":\"\"},{\"id\":88983,\"title\":\"Lemony Garlic Shrimp Pasta\",\"energy_kcal\":502.2,\"protein_g\":33.4,\"